            {
              "id": "art-body",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "span": 9
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "In trucking, the right part at the right time can mean the difference between making a delivery or losing a contract.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "For Florida fleets, the decision often comes down to two choices: ordering semi truck parts online or relying on local dealership service and parts counters. Both have their place, but knowing when to choose each option helps fleet owners balance cost, speed, and reliability.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State International, we serve customers who depend on both. This guide breaks down the advantages and trade-offs so you can make smarter, faster choices for your business.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-case-for-online",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The Case For Ordering Semi Truck Parts Online",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "case-for-online"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-case-for-online-1",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Convenience And Speed",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-case-for-online-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Ordering semi truck parts online allows fleet managers to shop from anywhere, anytime. No waiting in line, no phone tag; just quick searches and instant orders. This works especially well for common wear items that can be ordered in advance like filters, lights, and brake pads.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-case-for-online-3",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Broader Selection",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-case-for-online-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Online catalogs often provide access to a massive range of OEM and aftermarket parts. That means fleets running mixed brands can often source everything in one order.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-case-for-online-5",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Price Transparency",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-case-for-online-6",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "With online ordering, you see costs up front and can compare options across vendors. This transparency helps control budgets, especially when managing dozens of units.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-case-for-online-7",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "<strong>Best for:</strong> Routine replacements, bulk orders, and non-urgent needs.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-case-for-online-8",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "If there's a part you need ASAP, check out our online parts store. We offer a wide range of truck parts online so you can find what you need without leaving the office.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "co-case-for-online-9-row",
                  "type": "row",
                  "props": {
                    "gap": 0
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "co-case-for-online-9",
                      "type": "column",
                      "props": {
                        "span": 12
                      },
                      "styles": {
                        "base": {
                          "borderWidth": 1,
