                                "style": "link"
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-value-of-local",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The Value Of Local Service And Parts Departments",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "value-of-local"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-value-of-local-1",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Expert Guidance",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-value-of-local-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Local service counters offer what websites cannot: experienced advisors who know your trucks and your routes. They can recommend the right part the first time, avoiding costly mistakes.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-value-of-local-3",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Immediate Availability",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-value-of-local-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Even with fast shipping, waiting for parts can sideline trucks. At Sun State International, we have access to over 1 million parts, so fleets often get what they need the same day.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-value-of-local-5",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Integrated Service Support",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-value-of-local-6",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When you source parts locally, you also gain access to certified technicians who can install them correctly and quickly. This combination reduces downtime and ensures repairs meet OEM standards.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-value-of-local-7",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "<strong>Best for:</strong> Urgent repairs, complex components, and when downtime is not an option.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-value-of-local-8",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Need expert help? Come to one of our parts and service locations in Sarasota, Tampa, or Davenport.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-key-factors",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Key Factors To Consider Before Choosing",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "key-factors"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-key-factors-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When deciding between ordering semi truck parts online or buying locally, Florida fleet owners should weigh:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-key-factors-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Urgency: Is this part needed today, or can it wait for shipping?"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Complexity: Can your team install it, or does it require certified technicians?"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Cost vs. Downtime: Is the cheaper online option worth the potential delay?"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Trust: Do you know the vendor is reliable and the part will fit your truck?"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "stats-key-factors-3",
                  "type": "statBand",
                  "props": {
                    "stats": [
                      {
                        "value": "$850–$1,000/day",
                        "label": "Estimated cost of an out-of-service vehicle, per FleetOwner, factoring in missed revenue, driver pay, and penalties"
                      },
                      {
                        "value": "1M+",
                        "label": "Parts Sun State International has access to for same-day availability"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-key-factors-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "In that context, saving a few dollars on parts may not outweigh the cost of waiting.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-hybrid-strategy",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Hybrid Strategy: The Best Of Both Worlds",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "hybrid-strategy"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-hybrid-strategy-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Smart fleets don't choose one option exclusively; they use both strategically.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "list-hybrid-strategy-2",
                  "type": "prose-list",
                  "props": {
                    "ordered": false,
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Use online ordering for planned maintenance, bulk orders, and non-critical items."
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Use local parts and service when you need expert advice, urgent turnaround, or integrated installation."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-hybrid-strategy-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "This hybrid approach helps fleets control costs without sacrificing uptime.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-how-we-support",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "How Sun State International Supports Both Approaches",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "how-we-support"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-how-we-support-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Sun State International understands that no two fleets are alike. That's why we've built solutions to support both online and local needs.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "cards-how-we-support-2",
                  "type": "card-lists",
                  "props": {
                    "variant": "compare",
                    "items": [
                      {
