                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-why-trust-us",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why Fleets Trust Sun State International",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "why-trust-us"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-trust-us-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Sun State International is more than a dealer; we're a partner for Florida's hardest-working fleets. As a family-owned business, we combine professionalism with personal care. Our values guide everything we do. From parts to service, we provide the support fleets need to stay profitable and safe.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-ready-to-choose",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Ready To Make Smarter Parts Decisions?",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "ready-to-choose"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-ready-to-choose-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Balancing online convenience with local expertise is the key to keeping Florida fleets efficient and profitable. Sun State International offers both, so you never have to choose between cost savings and uptime.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
